[Options]

[A.]
<h2>The Alliance</h2>
<i>When you make a new enemy, the thunder rumbles in delight, but when you make a new ally, the enemies shake in fright."<br>
--The DeathWalker, The Virtuous Warrior</i><br>
<p>Now that you are allied with the ^WaR^ guild, you have to kill the other two.

$Button=Kill,DoNothing,0

[Succeeded][BadTeamDead]
<h2>Success!</h2><br>
<i>^WaR^ Lord: ~wI told you, united we stand, divided we fall.
<$Config,Done{mission.fileName}=1>
$Button=Leave Missions,MissionAbort,0
$Button=Next Mission,MissionBegin,FW2

[ai1TempleHalfDead]
<i>^WaR^ Lord: ~wSave me, friend.<br>
$Button=Help Him,DoNothing,0

[ai2PriestDead]
<i>^WaR^ Leader: ~wYou could have helped our member...<br>
<i>You: ~wI know but...
<i>Guldan: ~wBut nothing...you lost your postition.
$Button=Go Home,MissionAbort,0
$Button=Kill Guldan,Tell,Kill

[Kill]
<i>^WaR^ Leader: ~wWhy did you do that?
<i>You: ~wI don't know.
<i>^WaR^ Leader: ~wNow we are out of a good leader, and the SPU and GOF will surely over run us.

[Failed]
<h2>Failure!</h2>
<p>You have proved unworthy of being your clan's leader, even if it was 2 vs 1 vs 1.
$Button=*You Have Died*,MissionAbort,0

[END]
